<h1>HalfSword-MP third-party notices</h1>
<p class="note">HalfSword-MP itself is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0 (LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE,
NOTICE). The software below is included in the release. This file is generated by
<code>cargo about</code> from about.toml and about.hbs at the repository root.</p>

<h2>Rust crates</h2>
<p class="note">Statically linked into hsmp-server.exe, hsmp-sidecar.exe, hsmp-master.exe,
hsmp-query.exe, hsmp-launcher.exe and the HSMPNative DLLs (main.dll, hsmp_lua.dll).</p>
<h3>Overview</h3>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul class="crates">
{{#each used_by}}
<li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}

